==Battleground==
*3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 11.33~13.33 seconds<sup>340f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*8 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>.
*2 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

